really decided on this yet.... I know that I am going to do something simple with candles, since we are having such a small number of people....\n \n I totally love this idea...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i38.photobucket.com\/albums\/e135\/shell12367\/beach%20wedding\/candles.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n and I found some similar on ebay, that are candleholders, so I might get these:\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com\/STARFISH-SHAPED-S-3-VOTIVE-Or-TEA-LIGHT-Candle-Holder_W0QQitemZ320155762010QQihZ011QQcategoryZ10034QQssPageNameZWDVWQQrdZ1QQcmdZViewItem\"&gt;Starfish Candleholders&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":106477,"PostDate":1189209961,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I haven't really decided on this yet.... I know that I am going to do something simple with candles, since we are having such a small number of people....<br \/> <br \/> I totally love this idea...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i38.photobucket.com\/albums\/e135\/shell12367\/beach%20wedding\/candles.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> and I found some similar on ebay, that are candleholders, so I might get these:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com\/STARFISH-SHAPED-S-3-VOTIVE-Or-TEA-LIGHT-Candle-Holder_W0QQitemZ320155762010QQihZ011QQcategoryZ10034QQssPageNameZWDVWQQrdZ1QQcmdZViewItem' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'